    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Lofi Aquarium is a tool game designed to enhance work focus. Each time you complete a Pomodoro timer, you earn a bunch of tomato rewards. You can raise fish while you work, and the tomato rewards you earn will boost the growth rate of your fish. The harder you work, the faster your fish will grow. You can also earn more decorations or deep-sea plants. Use the money earned from your fish to create your own unique aquarium.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Fish Seed Packs to Unlock Rare Species!</h2>While you work, your fish will gradually grow. Once they mature, you can sell them to earn coins, which can be used to draw more new fish (this process is random). You can also keep these fish to collect them, name them, pet them, and deepen your bond with them. You can even establish a single-species fish school.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/0b266136d6d58c63f17618e9b1acc57e.poster.avif?t=1740208029\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/0b266136d6d58c63f17618e9b1acc57e.webm?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/0b266136d6d58c63f17618e9b1acc57e.mp4?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built-in Practical Productivity Tools:</h2>Includes carefully curated lofi music, customizable white noise, Pomodoro seeds, and work lists. Each time you complete a Pomodoro session, you earn tomatoes, giving you positive reinforcement.<br>You can freely combine lofi music with calming white noise, such as meditation, focused rain sounds, or film reel sounds, to help you get into an efficient working state.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/469edb1bb66026c8befaef00d044ce86.poster.avif?t=1740208029\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/469edb1bb66026c8befaef00d044ce86.webm?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/469edb1bb66026c8befaef00d044ce86.mp4?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feed your little fish during your work breaks. Hundreds of exquisite and rare fish species await your unlocking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Environments</h2>Paired with lofi music, these environments provide a focused space tailored to you. For example, an astronaut arrives in a strange space where a helmeted child plays the piano with an umbrella mysteriously appearing behind him. This might be a planet that fulfills people's wishes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/e66479d8ac3669f36c41882cd99267b8.poster.avif?t=1740208029\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/e66479d8ac3669f36c41882cd99267b8.webm?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/e66479d8ac3669f36c41882cd99267b8.mp4?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Positive Feedback for Focused Work</h2>Accumulating enough tomatoes can earn you decoration rewards, allowing you to create your unique aquarium.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/654f055be7c5fe41e5d286f54c9d0cd4.poster.avif?t=1740208029\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/654f055be7c5fe41e5d286f54c9d0cd4.webm?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/654f055be7c5fe41e5d286f54c9d0cd4.mp4?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And there's more to explore:<br><br>A wide variety of fish species await your unlocking.<br>Positive feedback from the Pomodoro timer: the harder you work, the more tomatoes you earn.<br>Continuously expand your aquarium space to raise more fish.<br>Increase the number of aquariums for more gaming experiences.<br>Scene spaces with hidden stories: a pianist in space, the secret of the hourglass, underwater, and more.<br>Dozens of customizable background white noise options to create your own immersive working state.<br>Dozens of lofi music tracks: lofi music, with its unique sense of loneliness and detachment, comforts the lonely urban crowd.<br>Idle growth gameplay, continuously accumulating achievements.",
    "about_the_game": "Lofi Aquarium is a tool game designed to enhance work focus. Each time you complete a Pomodoro timer, you earn a bunch of tomato rewards. You can raise fish while you work, and the tomato rewards you earn will boost the growth rate of your fish. The harder you work, the faster your fish will grow. You can also earn more decorations or deep-sea plants. Use the money earned from your fish to create your own unique aquarium.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Fish Seed Packs to Unlock Rare Species!</h2>While you work, your fish will gradually grow. Once they mature, you can sell them to earn coins, which can be used to draw more new fish (this process is random). You can also keep these fish to collect them, name them, pet them, and deepen your bond with them. You can even establish a single-species fish school.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/0b266136d6d58c63f17618e9b1acc57e.poster.avif?t=1740208029\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/0b266136d6d58c63f17618e9b1acc57e.webm?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/0b266136d6d58c63f17618e9b1acc57e.mp4?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built-in Practical Productivity Tools:</h2>Includes carefully curated lofi music, customizable white noise, Pomodoro seeds, and work lists. Each time you complete a Pomodoro session, you earn tomatoes, giving you positive reinforcement.<br>You can freely combine lofi music with calming white noise, such as meditation, focused rain sounds, or film reel sounds, to help you get into an efficient working state.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sha