t=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/654f055be7c5fe41e5d286f54c9d0cd4.webm?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051380/extras/654f055be7c5fe41e5d286f54c9d0cd4.mp4?t=1740208029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And there's more to explore:<br><br>A wide variety of fish species await your unlocking.<br>Positive feedback from the Pomodoro timer: the harder you work, the more tomatoes you earn.<br>Continuously expand your aquarium space to raise more fish.<br>Increase the number of aquariums for more gaming experiences.<br>Scene spaces with hidden stories: a pianist in space, the secret of the hourglass, underwater, and more.<br>Dozens of customizable background white noise options to create your own immersive working state.<br>Dozens of lofi music tracks: lofi music, with its unique sense of loneliness and detachment, comforts the lonely urban crowd.<br>Idle growth gameplay, continuously accumulating achievements.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Lofi Aquarium&quot; is a gamified focus tool designed to enhance concentration and relieve stress. As you work, a group of adorable baby fish will keep you company, all set to soothing lofi music. Over time, the fish grow and can be sold for profit. \ufeff",
